  "title": "How to build and deploy a Model Context Protocol (MCP) server",
  "summary": "The Model Context Protocol (MCP) is an open standard that’s revolutionizing how AI agents connect to external tools and data. While building a basic MCP server is straightforward, deploying, scaling, and securing it for production is a significant challenge. Metorial’s serverless MCP runtime simplifies this entire process, allowing developers to deploy robust, scalable MCP servers in just a few clicks, so they can focus on building innovative AI applications instead of managing infrastructure.",
